'' A type named above its own declaration -- 9 errors on fbc-modern 1.20 and 1.10.1 alike,
'' on exactly these lines (2026-09-19): fbc's 14 in a DIM, a field, a result and over a
'' typedef and an enum, 59 in a parameter, 17 in a CAST. From line 30 on is accepted by
'' both: a type naming itself, and the forward declaration 'type X as X_'.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/type-declared-below.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 9
'' EXPECT-OUT: type-declared-below.bas(6,8): error TKO0784: the type 'tlater' is used above its declaration
